Changes made for LivingWall: a WebKit message bridge so the macOS app can send
desktop icon positions, support for macOS point coordinates, direct scene
updates during an icon drag, Beach palms that keep their placement during a
drag, and Animation and Shadows switches. Shared/sprite.js and
Shared/playback.js are small LivingWall helpers that these themes load; they
are released here under the same license.

